OpenKara Bilibili QuickJS source (org.openkara.bilibili-quickjs)
Copyright David Weng and contributors.

This package is distributed under AGPL-3.0-only (see LICENSE). It is a
Streaming Source plugin for OpenKara and runs on the embedded QuickJS
(`openkara-js`) runtime: `dist/entry.mjs` is a single self-contained ES module
built from `src/` (the AGPL corresponding source) with the pinned
devDependency esbuild@0.28.1 (see package.json/package-lock.json).

The Bilibili wire (video detail, playurl, favorites and QR sign-in endpoints
and the request shapes) is ported from GentleM4dman/mygo-music-bilibili,
commit 3b0aa100d425b59504570ca84bdace80877ac26d (see SOURCES.md). That
project is MIT licensed:

  Copyright (c) 2026 GentleM4dman

The fixed upstream MIT license text is included in
LICENSES/mygo-music-bilibili-MIT.txt.

Third-party build tooling (esbuild) is a development-only dependency and is
not shipped in the source archive.
